      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PIN DEEP (2) sat on the pace last time and fought on well when a nose away in second over 1000m at this track. That continued the consistent run of form this prep and from the inside alley with relief from the jockey claim, he looks a major player. NICCIMOTA (4) comes here off a last-start fifth, beaten 1.4 lengths in the same race as PIN DEEP. Also has a claiming rider aboard and is drawn nicely in the middle of the field. Through the same race is PINGERS (5), who was beaten 1.4 lengths into fourth. Lucy Fiore gets the best out of this five-year-old mare and is right in this. TOO DARN STORMY (7) finished outside the top four for the first time in his career last time, so he deserves another chance and should be peaking third-up.",
